# The log of the test must have a line for each of these patterns (grep -E).
# 1. The police boat. The contact gives no script event. The player goes on to the south with a part to the east,
#    and it comes to the wall at the edge of the dock.
Harness: hitwall JCDentonMale0 actor=NYPoliceBoat0 normal=\(0\.9[0-9] 0\.[12][0-9] 0\.00\) no event, the wall does not face against the way
\[3\.50\].* dump JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(-479[0-9] 101[0-9][0-9] -259\) .* Velocity=\(X=[1-9][0-9]\.[0-9]+, Y=-3[0-9][0-9]\.
\[4\.50\].* dump JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(-478[0-9] 10053 -259\)
# 2. The double door. The player slides 54 units along the door, to the door frame.
Harness: hitwall JCDentonMale0 actor=DeusExMover1[67] normal=\(0\.00 1\.00 0\.00\) no event
\[6\.60\].* dump JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(-464[0-9] 228[0-9] -195\)
# 3. The stairs. The player is on the stairs along the side wall after 1 second, and at the top after 2 seconds.
\[9\.00\].* dump JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(22[0-9][0-9] 25[0-9] [0-9]+\) .* Velocity=\(X=(2[5-9]|3[0-2])[0-9]\.
\[10\.00\].* dump JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(249[0-9] 25[0-9] 157\)
# 4. The trash can, 50 degrees away from head-on. The player is past the can with its full speed, and the can
#    moved less than 40 units.
\[12\.30\].* dump TrashCan[0-9]+ .* loc=\(-469[0-9] 1056[0-9] -271\) .* bPushable=True Mass=50\.000000
\[13\.30\].* dump JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(-45[0-9][0-9] 105[01][0-9] -259\) .* Velocity=\(X=3[0-9][0-9]\.
\[13\.30\].* dump TrashCan[0-9]+ .* loc=\(-46[5-8][0-9] 105[56][0-9] -271\)
# 5. The trash can head-on. The player pushed the can more than 90 units in 1.5 seconds. It is behind the can, and
#    its speed is about a third of the walking speed.
\[16\.10\].* dump JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(-4[56][0-9][0-9] 1043[01] -259\) .* Velocity=\(X=([89][0-9]|1[0-2][0-9])\.
\[16\.10\].* dump TrashCan[0-9]+ .* loc=\(-45[0-9][0-9] 1043[01] -271\) dist=4[0-9] lastRendered
# 6. The soldier. It stays at its place. A contact with a pawn gives no script event. The player is past the soldier
#    with its full speed.
Harness: hitwall JCDentonMale0 actor=UNATCOTroop10 normal=\(-0\.[78][0-9] 0\.[56][0-9] 0\.00\) no event, the actor is a pawn
\[18\.00\].* dump UNATCOTroop10 .* loc=\(-4691 10300 -259\) .* GroundSpeed=0\.000000
\[18\.50\].* dump JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(-47[34][0-9] 101[0-9][0-9] -259\) .* Velocity=\(X=-?[0-9]\.[0-9]+, Y=-3[0-9][0-9]\.
\[18\.50\].* dump UNATCOTroop10 .* loc=\(-4691 10300 -259\)
!Accessed None
